{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game may be rage inducing when exploring a new maze.</strong><br><br>You can choose your difficulty, so you can decide to play casually or hardcore. And if you want to unlock all the achievements. <br> <br>Rotate the maze! To reach the end of each maze to keep the world's gears of time and space moving. <br> <br>Unlock abilities that will make your maze exploration easier, as you total up star gears from each maze! <br> <br> <strong>You can turn on/off the Pigeon Hole Masking in the Settings, it is meant to reduce dizziness, but you can only see the maze like seeing through a peeping hole.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b7e2e02f8c1547797cd5107da292000c.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b7e2e02f8c1547797cd5107da292000c.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b7e2e02f8c1547797cd5107da292000c.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate to move!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/4749aae2d9e028d00c61639bce33cade.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/4749aae2d9e028d00c61639bce33cade.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/4749aae2d9e028d00c61639bce33cade.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect star gears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0d16b92db5125107618d757c3d402fec.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0d16b92db5125107618d757c3d402fec.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0d16b92db5125107618d757c3d402fec.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the maze with star gears to progressively gain quality of life maze clearing abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/c9a173c077fff1c999529f8df445c43c.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/c9a173c077fff1c999529f8df445c43c.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/c9a173c077fff1c999529f8df445c43c.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play higher difficulty if you want to feel challenged! (difficulty is more impactful on levels after level 5)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0dd708dda9cc7fd1f7490e71830572ff.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0dd708dda9cc7fd1f7490e71830572ff.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0dd708dda9cc7fd1f7490e71830572ff.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Levels to play! 10 levels in each area!<strong> 5 area of mazes to complete! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game contains 3 endings<br> <br><strong>Story</strong> <br>G.O.T.S(Gear Of Time &amp; Space) has awakened. Not knowing what it really is, but it knows that it has to keep the world's gears running.      <br> <br>The remaining gears are wearing out, and they do not have any way to repair themselves. Play as G.O.T.S to repair the gear systems that runs the world!<br> <br><strong>Difficulty</strong> <br><strong>Normal -</strong>\u00a0No time limit, take as long as you need to clear the maze.  <br><strong>Hard -</strong>\u00a0Time limit and have to collect all of the star gears the maze contains.  <br><strong>Extreme -</strong> Includes previous difficulty, and an enemy that chases and neutralizes you.  <br>   <br>   <br>  Game was designed for Portrait mobile phones, but I have tested for square and landscape screens as well. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959830?t=1774694533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959830?t=1774694533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/c72f0108db0a85b4c8efc242e113a2d9183b96e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774694533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/c72f0108db0a85b4c8efc242e113a2d9183b96e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774694533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4038670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game may be rage inducing when exploring a new maze.</strong><br><br>You can choose your difficulty, so you can decide to play casually or hardcore. And if you want to unlock all the achievements. <br> <br>Rotate the maze! To reach the end of each maze to keep the world's gears of time and space moving. <br> <br>Unlock abilities that will make your maze exploration easier, as you total up star gears from each maze! <br> <br> <strong>You can turn on/off the Pigeon Hole Masking in the Settings, it is meant to reduce dizziness, but you can only see the maze like seeing through a peeping hole.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b7e2e02f8c1547797cd5107da292000c.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b7e2e02f8c1547797cd5107da292000c.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b7e2e02f8c1547797cd5107da292000c.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate to move!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/4749aae2d9e028d00c61639bce33cade.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/4749aae2d9e028d00c61639bce33cade.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/4749aae2d9e028d00c61639bce33cade.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect star gears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0d16b92db5125107618d757c3d402fec.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0d16b92db5125107618d757c3d402fec.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0d16b92db5125107618d757c3d402fec.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the maze with star gears to progressively gain quality of life maze clearing abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/c9a173c077fff1c999529f8df445c43c.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/c9a173c077fff1c999529f8df445c43c.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/c9a173c077fff1c999529f8df445c43c.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play higher difficulty if you want to feel challenged! (difficulty is more impactful on levels after level 5)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0dd708dda9cc7fd1f7490e71830572ff.poster.avif?t=1774694533\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0dd708dda9cc7fd1f7490e71830572ff.webm?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/0dd708dda9cc7fd1f7490e71830572ff.mp4?t=1774694533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Levels to play! 10 levels in each area!<strong> 5 area of mazes to complete! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game contains 3 endings<br> <br><strong>Story</strong> <br>G.O.T.S(Gear Of Time &amp; Space) has awakened. Not knowing what it really is, but it knows that it has to keep the world's gears running.      <br> <br>The remaining gears are wearing out, and they do not have any way to repair themselves. Play as G.O.T.S to repair the gear systems that runs the world!<br> <br><strong>Difficulty</strong> <br><strong>Normal -</strong>\u00a0No time limit, take as long as you need to clear the maze.  <br><strong>Hard -</strong>\u00a0Time limit and have to collect all of the star gears the maze contains.  <br><strong>Extreme -</strong> Includes previous difficulty, and an enemy that chases and neutralizes you.  <br>   <br>   <br>  Game was designed for Portrait mobile phones, but I have tested for square and landscape screens as well. </p>","developers":["LTYGUYDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/b90af9da8fa4faa2afedf4e60182f894